    "title": "冬コミのこと、と…！",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13101193.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20170508171151/http://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13101193.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "こんばんは、ブログかくかく詐欺の鹿乃です。ごめんなさい（土下座）"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "晚上好，我是说了半天“要写博客要写博客”却一直没写的鹿乃。对不起（土下座）"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Good evening, it's Kano, the \"I'll-write-a-blog-post\" fraud. I'm sorry (bowing to the ground)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "かなり遅くなりましたが冬コミのお話です！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "拖了挺久，来说说冬コミ的事！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It's very late, but here's the Winter Comiket news!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "完全寝落ちで申し込みミスをした鹿乃にななひらさんが手を差し伸べてくれたおかげで（ありがとうななひ〜〜）委託で冬コミ参加できることになりました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "申请时睡死过去、结果弄错了报名手续的我，多亏了ななひらさん伸出援手（谢谢你，ななひ〜〜），才能以委托的形式参加冬コミ。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I completely fell asleep and messed up my application, but Nanahira reached out a hand to help me (thank you Nanahi~~), so I'll be taking part in Winter Comiket on consignment."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "◆サークルスペース"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "◆社团摊位"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "◆Circle space"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "3日目西れ-26b 「confetto」"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "第3天 西れ-26b「confetto」"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Day 3, West れ-26b \"confetto\""
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "◆頒布物"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "◆贩售物"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "◆Items for sale"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "グッドハロー、メリー"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "《グッドハロー、メリー》"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Guddo Harō (Good Hello), Merī (Merry)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "トートバッグ、ストラップ"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "托特包、挂绳"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Tote bags, straps"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "◆冬コミ限定オマケ new"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "◆冬コミ限定特典 new"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "◆Winter Comiket-only bonus new"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "会場でCDを買ってくださった方に「お一人様一枚限定」で完全新作オリジナルおまけCDをプレゼントします。おまけは終わり次第終了で通販はありません！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "凡在现场购买 CD 的朋友，将「每人限一张」获赠全新制作的原创特典 CD。特典送完即止，不开放通贩！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Everyone who buys a CD at the venue will get a brand-new original bonus CD, \"limited to one per person\". The bonus ends when it runs out, and there's no mail order!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "楽曲はいつもお世話になっているU-skeさんで、歌詞は鹿乃です。近いうちにサンプル音源を鹿乃のTwitterにあげる予定ですのでお楽しみにしていてください(*^^*)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "曲子由一直承蒙关照的 U-ske 老师创作，歌词由鹿乃负责。近期我会把试听音源发到鹿乃的 Twitter 上，敬请期待(*^^*)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The music is by U-ske, who always helps me out, and the lyrics are by Kano. I'm planning to put up a sample on Kano's Twitter soon, so look forward to it(*^^*)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ちなみに過去にU-skeさんとご一緒した曲の動画をみることができます。よかったらこの機会に聴いてみてください！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "顺便一提，还能看到过去和 U-ske 老师合作的歌曲视频。感兴趣的话，不妨趁这个机会听听看！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "By the way, you can watch videos of songs I've done with U-ske in the past. Please give them a listen this time!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "card",
        "title": "http://sp.nicovideo.jp/watch/sm15556645",
        "url": "http://sp.nicovideo.jp/watch/sm15556645",
        "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20170508171151/http://sp.nicovideo.jp/watch/sm15556645"
      },
      {
        "type": "card",
        "title": "http://sp.nicovideo.jp/watch/sm17590521",
        "url": "http://sp.nicovideo.jp/watch/sm17590521",
        "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20170508171151/http://sp.nicovideo.jp/watch/sm17590521"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "◆注意事項"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "◆注意事项"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "◆Notes"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "今回は自分のスペースではなくお邪魔させていただく形になります。混雑が予想されますので1000円札、小銭をご準備ください。またサイン、撮影はお断りしています。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这次不是在自己摊位，而是要叨扰别的社团。预计现场会比较拥挤，请准备好 1000 日元纸币和零钱。另外，签名和拍照恕不接受。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This time I'm not at my own space but a guest at someone else's. It's expected to be crowded, so please have 1,000-yen bills and small change ready. Also, autographs and photos are not allowed."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "みんなに会場で会えるのを楽しみにしてます〜〜ちなみに、明日むふふなむふふがあるよ(*^^*)明後日もあるかも(*^^*)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "好期待能在会场和大家见面～～顺便说一句，明天有神秘的“嘿嘿”哦(*^^*)后天可能也有(*^^*)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I'm looking forward to seeing everyone at the venue~~ By the way, tomorrow there's a hehe-ish hehe(*^^*) Maybe the day after too(*^^*)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "インフルエンザとクリスマスニケサレル病が巷で蔓延しているようなので、心も体もあったかくしてお過ごしくださいっ"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "听说流感和“圣诞被甩病”正在街头巷尾蔓延，请大家让心和身体都保持暖暖和和地度过哦！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Influenza and the Christmas \"nikesareru\" sickness seem to be going around, so please keep both your heart and body warm!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "titleZh": "关于冬コミ的事、还有……！",
